  {
   "id": "kuroi-tsubasa-189825@1.3",
   "gameId": "kuroi-tsubasa-189825",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 1.3",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-05-03T09:29:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello friends,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "just a quick hotfix that (hopefully) fixes some weird behaviour regarding the True Blackwing achievement.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "At each startup now the unlocked CGs are counted and synched with the achievement. Additionally, the internal logic of counting should be more robust as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So if you've been hit by the \"0 progress\" issue despite having unlocked all images, in theory after the next startup of the game it should properly count. (Fingers crossed).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sorry for the inconvenience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
